  m_Name: Buffer Pool Preload
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  skillName: Buffer Pool Preload
  description: 'Just like the buffer pool of a high-level database, load the next
    batch of heavy instructions that need to be executed into the cache (in water)
    in advance. For any skills released in the next round, their CP consumption is
    forcibly reduced by 4 points (the minimum can be reduced to 0 CP). Counter win:
    Priority for skill release in the next round +1'
